            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Located in the centre of the community, we offer a wide selection of recreation activities. There are programs for all ages from preschoolers to seniors with arts and crafts, dance classes, language lessons and fitness programs just to name a few. The Centre features a full gymnasium, weight room, four multipurpose rooms, a kitchen and onsite parking. It also hosts an Ottawa Public Library kiosk and the Hunt Club-Riverside Community Services Centre. Outdoor space includes play structures, a basketball court, baseball diamond, two soccer fields and a rink.</p>
